# Line endings.
#
# The tooling in this repo assumes LF. `scripts/check-visual-system.mjs` and
# `check-science-copy.mjs` match frontmatter with `\n`-anchored regular
# expressions, and Prettier is configured for LF. On a Windows checkout with the
# default `core.autocrlf=true`, git rewrites tracked files to CRLF on checkout —
# which builds fine but silently turns those gates red, with a failure message
# ("coverDescription is too short") that points nowhere near the real cause.
#
# `eol=lf` makes the working tree LF on every platform, so the gates mean the
# same thing everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary

# Generated assets are checked in as-is.
public/og/*.png binary
public/resume/*.pdf binary
